WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.150
Lab 1, in the kit's folder.

2
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:05.413
Step 1 reads the plan the
devices are checked against.

3
00:00:05.413 --> 00:00:11.199
Rings 0 and 1 are in block; rings 2,
3 and the servers are still auditing.

4
00:00:11.199 --> 00:00:15.113
Step 2 runs the prevention
check, and finds three drifts.

5
00:00:15.113 --> 00:00:18.126
One device in ring 1 has
tamper protection off.

6
00:00:18.126 --> 00:00:22.687
One in ring 2 has network protection
off, though its ring should be auditing.

7
00:00:22.687 --> 00:00:25.812
And the file server has
datagram processing on,

8
00:00:25.812 --> 00:00:28.776
which Learn says to turn
off on high-UDP roles.

9
00:00:28.776 --> 00:00:31.685
Three inventory devices
have no state file:

10
00:00:31.685 --> 00:00:34.900
the two never onboarded,
and the excepted kiosk.
